# Iris — Codex Ignore Policy
# Purpose: Maintain token-efficiency by preventing Codex from indexing build folders, logs, local caches, and agent logs.

# --- Environment & Node ---
.env*
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
.next/
**/.next/
out/
**/out/
build/
**/build/
storybook-static/
.eslintcache
**/.eslintcache
next-env.d.ts
pnpm-lock.yaml

# --- Tests & Playwright ---
coverage/
**/coverage/
playwright-report/
**/playwright-report/
test-results/
**/test-results/
blob-report/
.playwright/

# --- Version Control ---
.git/
**/.git/
.github/

# --- IDEs & OS ---
.vscode/
.idea/
.DS_Store

# --- Logs & Temporaries ---
*.log
**/*.log
*.dump
*.sql.gz
*.tsbuildinfo
*.original.md

# --- Database & Local backups ---
db/backups/
db/migrations/meta/
db/migrations/**/*.json

# --- Agentic Noise & Local Tooling ---
.claude/
.superpowers/
.tokensave/
.headroom/
.playwright-mcp/
graphify-out/
skills-lock.json
.vercel/

# --- Voluminous Non-Code Documents (Token Waste) ---
THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md
LICENSE.md
LICENSE
CHANGELOG.md
GRAPH_REPORT.md
docs/archive/
!docs/archive/handoff-fase1.md
